    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm mostly worried about the speed of the release though. how much of an impact are we talking about with the blood meal? like, how soon can i expect to see the kale leaves changing color? also, are there any specific risks of overshooting the nitrogen levels if i use blood meal instead of something slower like bone meal?",
